---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import experience from '../content/experience/_ordered.json';
import working from '../data/working/_ordered.json';

// ✅ Local portrait as a real asset (no CLS, optimized)
import portrait from '../assets/personal.jpg';

const fmtMY = (iso) =>
  iso ? new Date(iso).toLocaleString('en-US', { month: 'short', year: 'numeric' }) : '';
const experienceDates = (item) => {
  if (!item.start) return '';
  const start = fmtMY(item.start);
  const end = item.end ? fmtMY(item.end) : item.current ? 'Present' : '';
  return end ? `From ${start} to ${end}` : `From ${start}`;
};

const cardBase = 'rounded-2xl bg-white border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden shadow-sm transition-all duration-300';
const card = `${cardBase} hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-1 p-5`;
---

<Layout
  title="About — Dimitrios Ntempos"
  description="Background, values, and work principles of Dimitrios Ntempos. Nine years building integration-heavy, API-driven products across AI and tech."
>
  <!-- Opportunistic prefetch for likely next pages -->
  <link rel="prefetch" href="/projects" />
  <link rel="prefetch" href="/essays" />

  <article>
    <!-- Intro -->
    <section class="mb-6" aria-labelledby="about">
      <div class="flex flex-col-reverse md:flex-row items-center md:items-start gap-8">
        <!-- Text -->
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h1 id="about" class="text-3xl font-bold mb-1 text-gray-900">About</h1>
          <p class="text-gray-700 font-semibold text-lg mb-3">
            I am driven by curiosity.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4 max-w-2xl">
          My path into technology did not start from a single discipline. It began with an early interest in chemistry, which sparked my curiosity about how complex systems behave. Later I studied economics and finance, moved into computer science, and eventually into product management.
          Across these fields I kept noticing the same patterns: systems, incentives, and the relationships between moving parts. That perspective continues to shape how I approach complex products and organizations today.
          </p>

          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4 max-w-2xl">
          Some of those ideas appear in the <a href="/essays" class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline">essays</a> I write on this site. Over time these ideas have shaped the way I approach product work. The principles below guide how I think, collaborate, and build systems that scale.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Portrait (local Image) -->
        <div data-no-invert class="flex-shrink-0">
          <Image
            src={portrait}
            alt="Portrait of Dimitrios Ntempos"
            width={260}
            height={260}
            loading="eager"
            fetchpriority="high"
            decoding="async"
            class="w-52 h-52 md:w-60 md:h-60 rounded-full object-cover border-4 border-white shadow-md"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Values -->
    <section class="mb-4" aria-labelledby="values">
      <h2 id="values" class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">Values</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
       The way products are built reflects the values behind them. These principles guide how I work, collaborate, and improve systems over time.
      </p>
      <div class="grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
        <div class={card}>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Simplicity</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">
            I reduce complexity before adding features. Clear structure scales better than clever solutions, especially in systems that must evolve.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class={card}>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Transparency</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">
            I share context early — assumptions, trade-offs, and risks. Alignment improves when uncertainty is visible rather than managed quietly.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class={card}>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Community</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">
            Strong products emerge from diverse thinking. I value disagreement, structured debate, and collective ownership over individual heroics.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class={card}>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Craftsmanship</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">
            I treat product work as a craft. That means sharpening judgment, refining systems, and improving execution with every iteration.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Craftsmanship -->
    <section class="mb-4" aria-labelledby="professional">
      <h2 id="professional" class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">How I work</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Over the past decade I’ve worked within startups and scaleups designing resilient systems, automating workflows, and translating data into measurable outcomes. I’m most effective where product, data, and execution intersect.
      </p>

      <div class="grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
        {working.map((item, i) => (
          <div class={card} key={item.skill + i}>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">{item.skill}</h3>
            {item.tools?.length > 0 && (
              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-3">
                {item.tools.map((tool) => (
                  <span class="text-xs bg-gray-100 text-gray-600 dark:bg-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded-md font-medium">{tool}</span>
                ))}
              </div>
            )}
            {item.description && (
              <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                {item.description}
              </p>
            )}
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Experience -->
    <section class="mb-4" aria-labelledby="experience">
      <h2 id="experience" class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">Latest experience</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Across these roles I’ve led products from concept to scale — shaping strategy, improving operations, and aligning teams around clear outcomes. My work spans data, integrations, and product delivery, always with an eye on creating value that lasts.
      </p>

      <div class="relative">
        <ul class="space-y-8">
          {experience.map((item, i) => (
            <li key={(item.role || item.company) + i} class="relative flex gap-6">
              <!-- Timeline dot -->
              <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
                <div class="w-3 h-3 bg-indigo-600 rounded-full shadow-lg shadow-indigo-300 flex-shrink-0 mt-2.5">
                  {item.current && <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-indigo-600 rounded-full animate-ping opacity-75"></div>}
                </div>
                {i < experience.length - 1 && <div class="w-px h-20 bg-gradient-to-b from-indigo-200 to-indigo-50 mt-1"></div>}
              </div>

              <!-- Card content -->
              <div class="flex-1 mt-1 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-white to-gray-50/50 border border-gray-200/50 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 p-5 hover:border-indigo-200/50">
                <!-- Role as main heading -->
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold bg-gradient-to-r from-gray-900 to-gray-700 bg-clip-text text-transparent">{item.role || '—'}</h3>

                <!-- Company info row -->
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-600">{item.company}</p>
                  {item.current && (
                    <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full font-semibold">
                      Current
                    </span>
                  )}
                </div>

                <!-- Date and location -->
                {(item.start || item.location) && (
                  <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1">
                    {item.start && <span>{experienceDates(item)}</span>}
                    {item.start && item.location && <span>{' · '}</span>}
                    {item.location && <span>{item.location}</span>}
                  </p>
                )}

                <!-- Description -->
                {item.summary && (
                  <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2 leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line">{item.summary}</p>
                )}

                <!-- Tags -->
                {item.tags?.length > 0 && (
                  <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-1 pt-3 border-t border-gray-100/50">
                    {item.tags.map((tag) => (
                      <span class="text-xs bg-gray-100 text-gray-600 dark:bg-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-md font-medium hover:bg-gray-200 dark:hover:bg-gray-600 transition-colors cursor-default">{tag}</span>
                    ))}
                  </div>
                )}
              </div>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-6 flex justify-end">
        <a
          href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ntemposd"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          aria-label="View LinkedIn Profile"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-2.5 rounded-full text-sm font-medium
                bg-indigo-600 text-white hover:bg-indigo-700 transition-colors
                focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-indigo-400"
        >
          View more on LinkedIn →
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="mb-4" aria-labelledby="outside">
      <h2 id="outside" class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">Beyond work</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Outside of product work, I play and follow basketball closely, explore sports analytics, 
        and enjoy studying systems across different domains — from markets to team dynamics.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
